ement&nbsp;intensif.&nbsp;</span></p>"},{"id":"exelem_a06ff0b9-2714-4e05-b08c-ec25d3c1b432","type":"label","metrics":{"x":20,"y":240,"width":551,"fixed_width":"","height":46,"zindex":101},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p style=\"color: #115278; font-family: Arial; font-size: 20px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">c) Le scientifique qui a répondu aux questions des journalistes</span><br style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; craint pour l’avenir de la planète.</span></p>"},{"id":"exelem_5de952ba-d53d-4f6e-f555-f7b8480796ec","type":"label","metrics":{"x":20,"y":330,"width":596,"fixed_width":"","height":46,"zindex":102},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p style=\"color: #115278; font-family: Arial; font-size: 20px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">d) Les vieux timbres qu’il a collectionnés depuis son enfance valent</span><br style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;aujourd’hui une fortune.&nbsp;</span></p>"},{"id":"exelem_7939d574-2361-4b0d-9447-2c6109df99ae","type":"input","metrics":{"x":260,"y":360,"width":"150","height":"30","zindex":107},"text_format":{"font":"Arial Unicode MS","color":"#115278","size":20,"align":"center","html":true,"latex":false},"input_styles":{"color":"default","border_width":"md"},"text":""},{"id":"exelem_946533d8-7b5b-45c0-f2cf-6721e9b25f45","type":"input","metrics":{"x":40,"y":290,"width":"150","height":"30","zindex":106},"text_format":{"font":"Arial Unicode MS","color":"#115278","size":20,"align":"center","html":true,"latex":false},"input_styles":{"color":"default","border_width":"md"},"text":""},{"id":"exelem_8c22b6d2-860f-4e13-db7c-2c4948b406bd","type":"input","metrics":{"x":50,"y":200,"width":"150","height":"30","zindex":105},"text_format":{"font":"Arial Unicode MS","color":"#115278","size":20,"align":"center","html":true,"latex":false},"input_styles":{"color":"default","border_width":"md"},"text":""},{"id":"exelem_32b77650-662d-47d1-af2b-fe20046635a4","type":"input","metrics":{"x":50,"y":130,"width":"150","height":"30","zindex":104},"text_format":{"font":"Arial Unicode MS","color":"#115278","size":20,"align":"center","html":true,"latex":false},"input_styles":{"color":"default","border_width":"md"},"text":""},{"id":"exelem_a96a8553-9835-414c-9764-72a7988c9523","type":"label","metrics":{"x":20,"y":100,"width":565,"fixed_width":"","height":23,"zindex":103},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p style=\"color: #115278; font-family: Arial; font-size: 20px; font-weight: normal;\">a) Je compte aller à la boutique où tu as acheté ces chandails.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>"}]},"types":["Réponses écrites"],"theory":"<b>Rappel théorique&nbsp;</b><br><br>La subordination consiste à enchâsser une phrase, appelée<i>&nbsp;<font color=\"#FF8C00\">subordonnée</font></i>, dans une autre phrase, appelée&nbsp;<font color=\"#FF8C00\"><i>phrase enchâssante</i></font>.<br><br>La phrase subordonnée ne peut exister seule et elle est toujours introduite dans une phrase à l’aide d’un subordonnant.<br><br>• La&nbsp;<font color=\"#FF8C00\"><b>subordonnée relative</b></font>&nbsp;est enchâssée dans un GN&nbsp;;<br>Ex.&nbsp;:&nbsp;<i>Le musée des Beaux-Arts,&nbsp;<b>que tu as déjà visité</b>, présente actuellement une exposition sur l’impressionnisme.&nbsp;</i><br>• La&nbsp;<font color=\"#FF8C00\"><b>subordonnée complétive</b></font>&nbsp;est souvent enchâssée dans un GV ou dans un GAdj&nbsp;;<br>Ex.&nbsp;:&nbsp;<i>Manuelle n’a pas oublié&nbsp;<b>qu’elle doit passer à la pharmacie</b>.</i><br>• La&nbsp;<font color=\"#FF8C00\"><b>subordonnée complément de phrase</b></font>&nbsp;est enchâssée dans une phrase&nbsp;;<br>Ex.&nbsp;:&nbsp;<b><i>Lorsque vous avez frappé à la porte</i></b><i>, nous venions de terminer le repas.&nbsp;</i>&nbsp;<br>• La&nbsp;<font color=\"#FF8C00\"><b>subordonnée corrélative</b></font>&nbsp;est enchâssée dans un GN, un GAdj, un GAdv ou un GV.<br>Ex.&nbsp;:&nbsp;<i>Louis a&nbsp;<b>tellement</b>&nbsp;travaillé&nbsp;<b>qu’il est complètement épuisé</b>.</i>","explanation":""},{"id":"115888","name":"M3_gramm_jonctions_subordination_05","title":"<p><b>Réécris la subordonnée présente dans chaque phrase.</b></p>","canvas":{"width":650,"height":400,"elements":[{"id":"exelem_574975be-276d-4e33-d30e-1b87cc907fd9","type":"label","metrics":{"x":42,"y":93,"width":431,"fixed_width":"","height":21,"zindex":111},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p style=\"color: #115278; font-family: Arial; font-size: 20px; font-weight: normal;\"><font size=\"18\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">a) J’ignore quand il aura le temps de réparer cet évier.</font></p>"},{"id":"exelem_ef40a775-ebcf-42a5-c214-7001ed64e7c0","type":"input","metrics":{"x":60,"y":321,"width":"450","height":"25","zindex":110},"text_format":{"font":"Arial Unicode MS","color":"#115278","size":18,"align":"center","html":true,"latex":false},"input_styles":{"color":"default","border_width":"md"},"text":""},{"id":"exelem_dd54e3cd-1480-414e-dcad-3848c2ac5df4","type":"input","metrics":{"x":61,"y":254,"width":"450","height":"25","zindex":109},"text_format":{"font":"Arial Unicode MS","color":"#115278","size":18,"align":"center","html":true,"latex":false},"input_styles":{"color":"default","border_width":"md"},"text":""},{"id":"exelem_9b8cbdbb-15a5-4d86-cf39-165746c0d6e8","type":"input","metrics":{"x":59,"y":190,"width":"450","height":"25","zindex":108},"text_format":{"font":"Arial Unicode MS","color":"#115278","size":18,"align":"center","html":true,"latex":false},"input_styles":{"color":"default","border_width":"md"},"text":""},{"id":"exelem_aa44fcf0-2f17-44ab-e92a-f0ce9ea61e99","type":"input","metrics":{"x":59,"y":118,"width":